      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "1505 patients with combined chronic pain syndrome were treated. All of them suffered from different orthopedic pathology. Lack of examination and mistakes of previous treatment lead us for this investigation. Using different kind of blocks in treating patients at the visit was a treatment method and decrease level of pain significantly during the first days, increase quality of life and motivation to recovery."},
